# Bloodthirsty Conqueror in a three-player game: "whenever an opponent loses life" triggers once for each opponent that loses
# life. Boltwave deals 3 damage to each of Bot2 and Bot3 at once (CR 120.2), so two triggers each gain Bot1 3: 20 + 6 = 26.
# One trigger per opponent and not one for the pair is what the 26 shows (a single trigger would give 23 or 29).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bloodthirsty Conqueror
Boltwave
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bloodthirsty Conqueror.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Boltwave.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 17
? Bot3.Life = 17
? Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Triggers(Bloodthirsty Conqueror; Bloodthirsty Conqueror)
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

